{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>This is the land that shall fall to you, etc.</b> Because many commandments apply in the Land and do not apply outside the Land, it was necessary to write the corners of its borders on every side — to tell you that from these borders inward, the commandments apply." "<b>Shall fall to you.</b> Because it was divided by lot, it is called a division in the language of falling. And another says: By this the Holy One, blessed be He, caused the princes of the seven nations to fall from heaven and bound them before Moses; He said to him: See, they have no more power."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 34, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:13:41.128081919Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}